[{"title":"寄马默斋 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"山阴元有兴，画舫在须登。\n闭阁思君子，开门见老僧。\n骑驴山路隐，挂席海波腾。\n揣度安危事，如公恐未能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42561,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月坐","author":"陈献章","text":"林深月到迟，爱月坐成痴。\n平生不戚戚，衰老尤嬉嬉。\n曾西卑管仲，孟子述宣尼。\n何事由求辈，区区欲有为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42562,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀古","author":"陈献章","text":"千里拜林宗，行藏未始同。\n诸贤皆好义，夫子独时中。\n东汉非刘氏，西山是阆风。\n堂堂四百载，载籍为谁空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42563,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读西涯李学士撰赵员外沧江别墅记","author":"陈献章","text":"江空秋月清，月出秋江明。\n水月自相得，乾坤谁与争。\n作亭赵员外，属记李先生。\n何时理烟艇，载酒下南京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42564,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"思亲堂","author":"陈献章","text":"父子自天性，谁能咏蓼莪。\n声容想如在，风木悲奈何。\n草露滴秋陇，庭乌号夜柯。\n思亲两眼泪，万古注江河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42565,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑巡检休官还莆","author":"陈献章","text":"卑栖一枝足，高举入云层。\n大鹏非斥鴳，斥鴳非大鹏。\n卑高各有适，小大不相能。\n归去木兰溪，溪鱼美可罾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42566,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀古","author":"陈献章","text":"皇皇复皇皇，开辟到陶唐。\n迟日江山丽，春风花草香。\n闾阎尽孝弟，简册无祯祥。\n乾坤十二会，巳午任中央。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42567,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万松草屋 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"南山爱夫子，夫子爱南山。\n孤鹤去千载，万松栖半间。\n无愁催白发，有药驻朱颜。\n夜半风雷作，龙来问大还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42568,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万松草屋 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"畏途千百转，回首见诸山。\n若个幽求子，结茅松树间。\n希夷归华顶，黄绮在商颜。\n分我青精饭，从君亦不还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42569,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄太虚上人 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"太虚石洞居，孤绝少人依。\n远客携琴至，逢师乞食归。\n一莆青草上，四面白云飞。\n尽日无言说，岩花落满衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42570,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄太虚上人 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"定山聊作主，石洞更无邻。\n劝我无多事，如公是一人。\n朝闻履虎尾，莫见批龙鳞。\n莫笑杨朱小，杨朱解爱身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42571,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日寄丁明府","author":"陈献章","text":"病里登高意，村边社树苍。\n有欢开酒禁，无力控诗狂。\n老鬓花簪丑，秋襟水照凉。\n如何丁明府，不肯共重阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42572,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊节后五日丁明府彦诚携酒来饮白沙社赋补会 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"秋色上篱尖，天高霜气严。\n对花无阿堵，笑我似陶潜。\n节去杯盘在，公来吏隐兼。\n江门赋补会，胜话无穷年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42573,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊节后五日丁明府彦诚携酒来饮白沙社赋补会 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"此日还供酒，人情盖亦难。\n暂随明府醉，断送菊花残。\n极浦明秋日，临流弄晚竿。\n遥怜张阃幕，相忆在长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42574,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊节后五日丁明府彦诚携酒来饮白沙社赋补会 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"百里非无地，东篱不借人。\n因君九日爱，倾此一杯春。\n菊谢人间世，官閒酒处身。\n想无厌花意，投辖暮江滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42575,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊","author":"陈献章","text":"种菊不盈区，挥金每顾馀。\n古今閒计较，俄顷失欢娱。\n西廪高堆粟，东楼剩贮书。\n路旁杨柳树，憔悴不成疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42576,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋晚","author":"陈献章","text":"皎皎月又缺，鲜鲜菊可收。\n汀云迷岛屿，山雨落扶留。\n市有屠牛杌，江连逻吏舟。\n恐无赊酒处，垂白对清秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42577,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈方伯耻庵挽诗 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"乾坤如此老，没齿向斯文。\n公自沧溟水，人无觳觫君。\n衣冠全素履，江海挹清芬。\n病起须持酒，青山欲到坟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42578,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈方伯耻庵挽诗 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"中年倦俯仰，上疏乞山林。\n黾勉南州牧，迟回北极心。\n民蒙三日雨，世病一钩金。\n殄瘁声悲处，龙蛇岁值今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42579,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"挥汗书难继，清心雨未来。\n手提弱丝去，风撼社门开。\n指点封君句，摩挲土栋苔。\n松根吾欲卧，返照又相催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42580,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"晚凉慰我渴，秋暑著人烦。\n拄杖缘溪足，看湖到柳根。\n哦诗衰骨痛，开卷病眸昏。\n六月飞云冷，相思只断魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42581,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚步 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"居常懒出户，肯到社西头。\n海国诸峰暝，乾坤六月秋。\n微凉生浦树，返照下西楼。\n今夕蒲团上，前山更卧游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42582,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崔清献公裔孙潜示遗芳卷复许示遗像予既书纪梦之作于其还也赠之诗","author":"陈献章","text":"积雨阶苔上，经旬断履痕。\n谁为门下客，公是菊坡孙。\n泽与流风远，名因避相尊。\n丹青遗像在，何日照江门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42583,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太夫人晚归携诸孙候于贞节桥下 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"寒花明隔坞，暝色欲归潮。\n未愁山路黑，莫放板车摇。\n耄耋供人事，儿孙候此桥。\n殷勤望四崦，风急暮云飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42584,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太夫人晚归携诸孙候于贞节桥下 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"延缘看落日，伊轧到溪西。\n丫路依冈转，垂萝拂盖低。\n喜从中道见，痴效小儿啼。\n报赐心何极，乾坤圣寿齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42585,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕上偶成","author":"陈献章","text":"翰苑无官府，蒲团了岁年。\n岩云交树白，水月印沙圆。\n懒甚陶元亮，閒于魏仲先。\n吾曹生分薄，于福敢求全。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42586,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅村诗次韵黎雪青","author":"陈献章","text":"梅村梅发早，已过赏花期。\n玄酒初无味，名家岂在诗。\n井寒人汲少，川暝鸟飞卑。\n高枕沧溟者，神仙定不疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42587,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵秋兴感事录寄东所 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"秋露落芙蓉，河山日不同。\n物情诗卷里，天道雨声中。\n朝出马愁坂，暮行船逆风。\n欲投云谷隐，鞭鹤上层空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42588,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵秋兴感事录寄东所 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"昆崙一池水，色与银河同。\n问子为谁氏，从师向此中。\n短檠非世业，破笠是家风。\n回首唐虞际，浮云点太空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42589,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵秋兴感事录寄东所 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"首阳非立异，柳下不妨同。\n岁月黑甜外，乾坤软饱中。\n腐儒甘粝食，烈士死长风。\n今古谁能计，贤愚并一空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42590,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得林子逢书感平湖事赋此次前韵 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"平湖千里水，浣濯与谁同。\n咄咄诸魔里，冥冥一梦中。\n支离深岁月，感慨极秋风。\n点检希颜处，吾瓢合屡空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42591,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得林子逢书感平湖事赋此次前韵 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"同人未为失，子不善为同。\n宦况浮云外，生涯大鳖中。\n孤篙撑急水，弱羽试冲风。\n佛者空诸有，吾儒亦有空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42592,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与梁文冠","author":"陈献章","text":"铅椠谁分付，闻君有义方。\n纸田须乐垦，画果岂堪尝。\n得雨花蹊润，随风鸟韵长。\n公来诗不少，排日两三章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42593,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客","author":"陈献章","text":"客访贫家少，连旬幸作东。\n笙簧都万籁，俎豆亦千峰。\n冠带迎人懒，情怀傍酒浓。\n白头君莫笑，醉袖舞春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42594,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月廿七日五鼓起索衣往来房户间失脚仆地伤面咎在不谨然亦衰年久病气弱无力之验也为诗以自悼 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"胫骨衰无力，颠危刚莫支。\n少年非一蹶，今日独多悲。\n形模甘老丑，面目对人疑。\n呼儿教涤血，不忍报慈闱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42595,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月廿七日五鼓起索衣往来房户间失脚仆地伤面咎在不谨然亦衰年久病气弱无力之验也为诗以自悼 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"风捲芭蕉雨，南窗夜拥衾。\n人当惩乐正，我已愧曾参。\n一一观天命，时时动此心。\n林间子规鸟，那更助悲吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42596,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄张进士廷实","author":"陈献章","text":"是诗难入俗，正坐不雕镌。\n水满鱼争跃，花深蝶喜穿。\n日高云卧处，春在鸟啼边。\n不及陈无已，能无赏自然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42597,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偕伍伯饶杨伯顺甥舅顺德李子长游李村山","author":"陈献章","text":"游走意何穷，天枢日夜东。\n青山都老脚，破笠又春风。\n径草分遥碧，岩花坠小红。\n乾坤浑欲到，何处问壶公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42598,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昼睡偶成寄玉台文定上人","author":"陈献章","text":"老脚春还短，名山梦每登。\n玉台天上寺，文定意中僧。\n得法休藏钵，传心信有灯。\n道人北窗下，一枕一瞢腾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42599,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日书事","author":"陈献章","text":"开年今日雨，疏柳小塘春。\n紫燕将归社，黄鹂欲唤人。\n未明事南亩，选日䀻西宾。\n元亮朝朝醉，江村白酒新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42600,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"驿吏送酒","author":"陈献章","text":"市榼通邮吏，三杯洗侍儿。\n十分春意思，一副酒肝脾。\n江岭长看画，风花不尽诗。\n混然天地内，公是醉乡谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42601,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日醉中言怀 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"山林亦朝市，朝市亦山林。\n两鬓白于旧，三杯狂到今。\n子云休儗赋，元亮已忘琴。\n南山千丈石，可以明我心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42602,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日醉中言怀 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"古人不可见，空见古人心。\n春风开我盏，流水到谁琴。\n无说可传后，何才敢议今。\n玉台花信少，扶杖更西林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42603,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客谈诗","author":"陈献章","text":"风雅馀三百，唐音仅几家。\n梦犹将影说，痒莫隔靴爬。\n岂是安排定，胡为孟浪誇。\n超然不到处，应是用心差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42604,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中李世卿往还","author":"陈献章","text":"助谈风满席，伴宿月流衾。\n贫贱交游冷，江山脚迹深。\n惠连何处梦，孟母此时心。\n稍歇松斋雨，还来辨绣针。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42605,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得林宪副待用书有怀故友张兼素","author":"陈献章","text":"蹇蹇张兼素，从君致匪躬。\n天来今日定，书展故人封。\n贾傅生还恸，湘累死亦忠。\n平生两行泪，万里寄秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42606,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄容贯圭峰 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"西风扶策上，病骨快新凉。\n乞米分僧饭，闻香过梵堂。\n闭门秋竹静，语鸟暮钟藏。\n浩浩蒲团上，还同在醉乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42607,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄容贯圭峰 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"落日荒台上，疏松古塔边。\n身休论出世，趣欲到无弦。\n峰阁初生月，渠通自到泉。\n西庵凭借问，许住过残年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42608,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村晚望寄世卿圭峰","author":"陈献章","text":"一望一延缘，诸山进目前。\n乡邦无一老，知旧半重泉。\n黄叶寺旁下，白云池上连。\n无穷幽涧水，日夜注东川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42609,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠黄进士廷章还京","author":"陈献章","text":"锦衣在亲旁，饮酒日百觞。\n乐处嫌春短，离心向夜长。\n青云冠盖起，黄甲姓名香。\n五色持文线，千年补舜裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42610,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白雀群飞益高","author":"陈献章","text":"取势翩翩上，江空暮雨馀。\n情轻鸠并妇，声细雁呼奴。\n白雪洒孤嶂，青天开一图。\n安能随蚱蜢，跳踯在泥涂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42611,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得林别驾书云去秋九月尝梦予于广信舟中兼示道路所闻","author":"陈献章","text":"潦倒年斯迈，芳菲日自迟。\n忽闻天上梦，又落世间疑。\n扛鼎须凭力，无才敢与知。\n涪翁亦秋思，漫寄颖滨诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42612,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重过大忠祠","author":"陈献章","text":"宋有中流柱，三人吾所钦。\n青山遗此庙，终古厌人心。\n月到厓门白，神游海雾深。\n兴亡谁复道，猿鸟莫哀吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42613,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵寄廷实 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"吾犹堪起倒，吾肯谢亲宾。\n在世宁须此，如公故可人。\n百年应得见，一面始能亲。\n独向湘江去，无忘越岭春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42614,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑室 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"垂老无筋力，宁非板筑人。\n居常只谩过，即事始知贫。\n海国秋风早，山房夜气新。\n痴儿解了事，吾坐养吾真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42615,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"筑室 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"一室无多事，贫家每作难。\n从来无厚积，况复不能悭。\n贷粟干知友，营材入远山。\n三间开土阁，聊得奉慈颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42616,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送景易赴秋试","author":"陈献章","text":"未达穷通理，难忘得失心。\n安能谢朝市，且莫厌山林。\n烹鼎须兼味，吹竽当好音。\n文章无定价，敝帚不论金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42617,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"图新书舍怀世卿时别白沙半月","author":"陈献章","text":"月上斋垣白，疏梅共主宾。\n偶来对月饮，不见如花人。\n已觉书难至，常疑梦与亲。\n海山犹在眼，何处却逢春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42618,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙眼","author":"陈献章","text":"龙眼何年种，嗟嗟旧主人。\n卑柯今蔽日，腐骨已成尘。\n春雨沾花足，秋虫食实频。\n流形非木石，鬓脚半搔银。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42619,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"始闻秋风作","author":"陈献章","text":"西风中夜起，天地始肃清。\n白雁霜前意，玄蝉露下声。\n幽人亦何事，版筑初经营。\n何时登此阁，坐望罗浮征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42620,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题容氏挽册","author":"陈献章","text":"中秋悲迹扫，秋思忽依依。\n此夜月还照，何年鹤始归。\n?啼新宰木，巷纳旧蓑衣。\n大块终同尔，谁能驻落晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42621,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"山竹深深径，梅花浅浅塘。\n清冷朝弄影，芬馥夜浮香。\n瘦骨交撑月，横梢直过墙。\n啄英终饱德，灵凤或来翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42622,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"探梅非探梅，梅花满玉台。\n北风吹尽日，疏雪点荒苔。\n色得乾坤正，精成造化胎。\n无人知老子，刚坐一牛来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42623,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"何处寻梅好，罗浮海上春。\n树环铁桥尽，地与葛仙邻。\n炼药香生鼎，扳崖影落身。\n西湖千顷水，未洗往来尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42624,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其四","author":"陈献章","text":"彼美枝头雪，微韬岭上云。\n低迷明月寺，掩映葛洪坟。\n北海樽能倒，西湖地索分。\n幽香偷未得，衫袖细氤氲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42625,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花 其五","author":"陈献章","text":"手种梅千树，山寒半欲花。\n岁阑知此意，溪上问谁家。\n素艳明争雪，青萝倒绾蛇。\n还须邵康节，来驾白牛车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42626,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"逐客","author":"陈献章","text":"笛声且莫哀，逐客过江隈。\n还到此边去，尽因何事来。\n著书多在箧，遇酒辄衔杯。\n莫言生意尽，寒雨湿枯荄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42627,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得张主事廷实书 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"十口虽无累，三年不易更。\n春雷轰令问，枯木嚼官情。\n长夜乡心切，何时会计成。\n登高望东海，到眼是蓬瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42628,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得张主事廷实书 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"新凉欺老臂，索被过残更。\n月到思君处，书通在客情。\n有家宁免累，作吏转难成。\n日踏皮鞋破，思量旧阆瀛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":42629,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]